{
  "scenario": "The order stage searches the lines in two orderings (headroom per price before, and after, the product discount) and keeps the better one. Line 1: 1 000 Kč with 90 % off (100 Kč left), cost 49,99 Kč → 50 Kč it can give; line 2: 100 Kč, cost 94,99 Kč → 5 Kč. Per price before the discount both have 5 %, so they enter together and line 2 limits the order to 10 Kč; per price after it, line 1 (50 %) alone carries the whole 50 % of 100 Kč. So the order discount is 50 Kč on line 1 (an exact amount), line 2 left out.",
